<view class="container">
  <view class="banner-note">
    全身/距离由剪影引导 + 自检清单确认（非姿态识别）。服务端真实校验：时长、分辨率、亮度、方向。
  </view>

  <view class="card silhouette-card">
    <view class="card-title">剪影引导（示意）</view>
    <view class="silhouette">
      <view class="sil-head"></view>
      <view class="sil-body"></view>
      <view class="sil-legs"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted">请站入剪影范围：全身入镜、距离约 3–5 米、竖屏、球拍可见。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">拍摄前清单（须全部勾选）</view>
    <label class="check-row" wx:for="{{checklist}}" wx:key="key">
      <checkbox
        value="{{item.key}}"
        checked="{{item.checked}}"
        bindtap="toggleCheck"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
      />
      <text>{{item.label}}</text>
    </label>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">选择或录制视频</view>
    <view class="muted">推荐：wx.chooseMedia（开发者工具更稳）。真机也可用相机组件录制。</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:16rpx;" bindtap="chooseMedia">从相册/相机选择视频</view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top:16rpx;" bindtap="toggleCamera">{{showCamera ? '关闭相机预览' : '打开相机预览（真机）'}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{showCamera}}">
    <camera
      device-position="back"
      flash="off"
      style="width:100%;height:420rpx;"
    ></camera>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-top:12rpx;">开发者工具中 camera 可能不可用；请用「选择视频」。真机可结合系统录像后 chooseMedia。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{videoPath}}">
    <view class="card-title">已选视频</view>
    <video src="{{videoPath}}" controls style="width:100%;"></video>
    <view class="muted">{{videoInfo}}</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:16rpx;" bindtap="doUpload" wx:if="{{!uploading}}">上传并预检</view>
    <view class="muted" wx:else>上传中…</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{failChecks.length}}">
    <view class="card-title" style="color:#b91c1c;">预检未通过 — 请重拍</view>
    <view wx:for="{{failChecks}}" wx:key="id" class="fail-item">
      · [{{item.id}}] {{item.message}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
</view>
